---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Support"
  description="Support information for Benedict Interactive products."
>
  <section class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
    <h1>Clear help, without the maze.</h1>
    <p>
      This support area is part of the website foundation. Product-specific support flows,
      contact routing, FAQs, and release information will be added before public launch.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell support-grid">
    <article class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Bearagnostic</p>
      <h2>Product support</h2>
      <p>
        Documentation, known issues, release notes, and troubleshooting will live here rather
        than being scattered across social platforms.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Benedict Interactive</p>
      <h2>One official home</h2>
      <p>
        The long-term support model will keep canonical information on the official site even
        when products are also distributed through third-party marketplaces.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
